# The vendored W3C suites are conformance fixtures whose exact bytes are the
# test: query text, RDF data, and expected result serializations compared
# literally. Some hold literals containing raw line feeds, whose value would
# change if a checkout translated them to CRLF -- the failure odin-rdf-parser
# hit on Windows, latent here only because this repo's CI is macOS-only.
tests/w3c/** -text

# Odin sources are ordinary text wherever they sit, including the suite
# harness inside the directory above. Last matching pattern wins.
*.odin text=auto
